From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NotAlexNoyle <alexnoyle@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:58:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] js: a source compression no helper has started runs on the
 thread that waits for it

The daemon deadlocked on GitHub's module scripts (2026-11-12, on the TouchPad, stacks read
with ptrace): the main thread in BytecodeCompiler::maybeCompleteCompressSource waiting for
its source's compression, and both helper threads the same, each in an off-thread module
parse (ModuleParseTask -> CompileModule) waiting for its own. Compression runs on a helper,
and the job's pool is two threads (JIHAD_JS_HELPER_THREADS=2): with every helper waiting
that way, nothing was left to run the compressions. Upstream's default pool (cores + 4)
leaves slack; any pool can run out.

SourceCompressionTask::complete() now takes a task no helper has started off the worklist
and runs it here; only one a helper is already running is waited for.

On the TouchPad, the job's caps and the watchdog off: the shipped engine hung on the first
GitHub load; with this, 12 loads in two rounds, none hung.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MpagfP34fXBdsc76E8YSzR
---
 js/src/vm/HelperThreads.cpp | 19 ++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/js/src/vm/HelperThreads.cpp b/js/src/vm/HelperThreads.cpp
index 6ead1d32de..0b765a9e23 100644
--- a/js/src/vm/HelperThreads.cpp
+++ b/js/src/vm/HelperThreads.cpp
@@ -1769,6 +1769,12 @@ SourceCompressionTask::complete()
     if (!active())
         return true;
 
+    // Jihad (2026-11-12): a task no helper has started is taken off the list and run here, on this
+    // thread; only one a helper is already running is waited for. Tasks on the helpers wait for their
+    // own sources' compression too (an off-thread module parse), so with every helper busy that way
+    // nothing was left to run the compressions: GitHub's module scripts deadlocked the daemon on the
+    // job's two-thread pool (JIHAD_JS_HELPER_THREADS=2), the main thread and both helpers waiting here.
+    bool runHere = false;
     {
         AutoLockHelperThreadState lock;
         JihadCompressMode mode = JihadJsCompressMode();
@@ -1784,9 +1790,17 @@ SourceCompressionTask::complete()
                 }
             }
         }
+        auto& queued = HelperThreadState().compressionWorklist(lock);
+        for (size_t i = 0; i < queued.length(); i++) {
+            if (queued[i] == this) {
+                queued.erase(&queued[i]);
+                runHere = true;
+                break;
+            }
+        }
         int64_t start = mode == JihadCompressMode::Log ? PRMJ_Now() : 0;
         bool waited = false;
-        while (HelperThreadState().compressionInProgress(this, lock)) {
+        while (!runHere && HelperThreadState().compressionInProgress(this, lock)) {
             waited = true;
             HelperThreadState().wait(lock, GlobalHelperThreadState::CONSUMER);
         }
@@ -1796,6 +1810,9 @@ SourceCompressionTask::complete()
         }
     }
 
+    if (runHere)
+        result = work();
+
     if (result == Success) {
         MOZ_ASSERT(resultString);
         ss->setCompressedSource(mozilla::Move(*resultString), ss->length());
